#etcsl: line-id=12

13. eš-bar-ra nam mu-un-di-ni-ib₂#-tar-re
#tr.en: and in decision determines the fates with him.
#lem: ešbar[decision]; nam[fate]; tar[cut]
#etcsl: line-id=13

14. ŋi₆-par₄ mah-a-ni 4 na-nam
#tr.en: His lofty @fsux{ŋipar} shrines number four.
#lem: ŋipar[cloister]; mah[great]; n; me[be]
#etcsl: line-id=14

15. (1:{du}du₈:1) 4 mu-un-na-ŋar-ra
#tr.en: There are four @varh[t41306.v5]{platforms } @vart[t41306.v6,t41306.v5]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} cattle pens } which he has established for him.
