:15v.1.1: ($1 ms. has instead:$) tur₃
#lem: tur[animal stall]

16. {e₂}tur₃ gal-a-ni eše₃{iku} 4-am₃
#tr.en: His great temple cattle pens, one @fsux{eše} in size, number four.
#lem: tur[animal stall]; gal[big]; eše[unit of area]; n
#etcsl: line-id=16

17. (1:{ŋiš}al-ŋar-surₓ(|UZ₃#.BALAG#|)-ra:1) mu-na-tag-tag-ge
