#etcsl: line-id=33

34. {d}nisaba-ke₄ šid-bi mu-un-dab₅
#tr.en: and she is writing it on clay.
#lem: Nisabak[1]DN; šid[count]; dab[seize]
#etcsl: line-id=34

35. im-ma bi₂-ib-gub-be₂-<<en>>
#tr.en: The holy cows of @wDN{Nanna},
